Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Servicii IT și consultanță IT
Dear job seeker,
We are always interested in connecting with talented IT Professionals who would like to be part of fme Romania . Whether your background is in software development, DevOps, QA, cloud, data, enterprise content management, data migration, project management, or other IT areas, we would be happy to get to know you and explore potential future opportunities.
At fme Romania , we work with a diverse range of customers including industrial companies, life science organizations, and financial institutions. Our customers rely on our professional advice, support, and innovative solutions to meet their digital service needs.
Even if we do not currently have an open position that matches your profile, joining our Talent Pool allows us to stay connected and reach out when a suitable opportunity becomes available.
 Areas of Interest
 We believe great talent deserves great opportunities. Share your profile with us if you have experience in any of the following areas.
 Our Key Area of Expertise:
Data Migration Services (Migration Engineers, Migration Specialists & Technical Leads) 
 We also welcome professionals in:
Frontend, Backend & Full-Stack Development;
DevOps, Cloud Engineering & AI Solutions;
Artificial Intelligence;
Manual & Automated Quality Assurance;
Data Analysis; 
Project Management;
IT Support & Infrastructure;
System Administration, Networking & IT Security
 Requirements
Relevant experience in the IT industry;
Relevant technical studies;
Good verbal and written communication skills in English;
Interest in professional growth and collaboration within international teams;
A proactive mindset and results-oriented approach;
Strong problem-solving and teamwork skills;
Openness to future opportunities that match your skills, experience, and career goals
 Nice to have:
German language skills;
Relevant technical certifications
 Benefits
 Here's our part of the deal: 
Be part of a mature, stable company with over 20 years in the market, combining long-term vision with modern engineering practices;
Work in an environment that supports your growth through an individual career plan and a dedicated learning & development budget;
Benefit from a comprehensive private health package, plus perks like WellHub, Bookster, and meal tickets;
Enjoy a comfortable, well-located office, easy to reach when working on-site;
Take advantage of a flexible work schedule that supports autonomy and work-life balance;
Connect with your colleagues through engaging company events and team activities
 Why join us?
Growth opportunities: be part of a team that is expanding globally and contribute to our success;
Innovative environment: work with cutting-edge technology and industry trends;
Dynamic culture: thrive in a fast-paced, results-driven environment
 We are fme, an innovative company with 20 years of experience in digital transformation, mature enough to handle complex projects, yet young at heart, providing a modern work environment for our team. As part of the fme Group, headquartered in Braunschweig, Germany, we have subsidiaries in Romania, the United States, and India.
Our mission is to help enterprises accelerate critical business processes, improve decision-making, and ensure information security and compliance using Enterprise Content Management, Business Intelligence, and Cloud technologies.
For over 20 years, fme Romania has grown through professionalism, adaptability, and collaboration. Get to know us: Watch our anniversary video .
